{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  CLUB GRUNT STYLE - JOIN STEPS
  Rebuilt from gs-shopify-v3 sections/club-gs-join-steps_v2.liquid
  ==================================================================
  Four-step subscription funnel: fit, size, plan, review. Adds the
  matching Club product to the cart on a Skio selling plan.

  v1 (club-grunt-style--join-steps.liquid) is NOT ported - superseded,
  untouched since Oct 2025. See DUP-016.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  KEYBOARD ACCESSIBILITY - THE WHOLE FUNNEL WAS UNUSABLE
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 hid the radio inputs with `display: none`. Such an input is removed
  from the accessibility tree and cannot be focused, so every step of a
  PAID SIGNUP FLOW was mouse-only. Inputs are now visually hidden but
  focusable, with the focus ring on the visible label - the same pattern
  as the PDP variant picker.

  Progress dots were disabled buttons toggled by script with no aria
  state. They now carry aria-current and are real navigation.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  HARDCODED COMMERCIAL VALUES ARE NOW SETTINGS
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 hardcoded, in markup and in JavaScript:
    - Skio selling plan IDs 1963917363 / 1963884595, with the previous
      Yotpo IDs left commented beside them
    - prices $25.00, $255.00, $300.00 and "15% OFF"
    - the product handle pattern club-{gender}-{plan}

  A price change or a Skio plan reissue meant a code change, and a wrong
  plan id fails SILENTLY - the item adds on the wrong billing terms.

  ACTION: confirm both plan IDs against Skio before launch. They are the
  single most breakable values in this file.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  DEPENDENCIES THAT DO NOT EXIST IN DAWN
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3's add-to-cart called three globals from its 283 KB theme.js -
  cartContentUpdate, drawerProductRecommendation, focusElementsRotation -
  and requested a section named 'ajax-cart-drawer'. None exist here, so a
  straight port would have failed at the moment of purchase.

  This uses Dawn's cart-drawer custom element, falling back to a
  navigation to the cart if the drawer is absent.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  FLICKITY REMOVED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 drove the four steps with Flickity (81.7 KB) configured
  draggable:false, prevNextButtons:false, pageDots:false - a carousel
  library used purely to show one panel at a time. That is a wizard.
  Plain show/hide, no library.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER v3 FIXES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  - TRAILING COMMA in the schema JSON. Seventh section found with this.
  - The size grid was locked to 7 columns even when 3XL and 4XL were
    hidden for the women's fit, leaving two empty cells.
  - Icons were hardcoded Shopify CDN URLs; now editable.
  - `.hidden` was declared as a global utility class from inside this
    section.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  VISUAL PARITY WITH v3 (2026-09-21)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The first rewrite used the theme's red line colour, square cards, no
  connector bars and no icons. The client wants the v3 look, so:
    - card, colour, size and spacing values are v3's (see the CSS)
    - the progress bar sits BELOW the panels, with 125x5 grey bars
      between the circles, and the current circle shows the step icon
      in place of its number (club logo / people / rank / bookmark)
    - the review step clones the three chosen cards, ribbon included,
      instead of listing label/value rows
    - the disclaimer sits between the heading and the plan cards
    - a successful join opens the cart drawer and resets the funnel
  Kept from the rewrite: focusable inputs, focus rings, aria-current,
  focus move between steps, the error message, reduced-motion.

  ICONS ARE THEME ASSETS. v3 hardcoded seven cdn.shopify.com/files URLs.
  Those files are copied into assets/ (gs-club-icon-*.{png,svg},
  gs-club-step-{1..4}.*) so the section is self-contained; each has an
  image_picker override in the schema.

  SIZE LABEL vs VARIANT TITLE. The Club products' variants are titled
  Small, Medium, Large, XL, 2XL, 3XL, 4XL but the cards show S, M, L.
  The `sizes` setting takes Label:Value pairs (S:Small,...); the value is
  what the variant lookup matches. A bare entry uses the same text for
  both. The old rewrite matched on the displayed text, which is why the
  template had to say "Small,Medium,Large".

  CART DRAWER. Dawn's cart-drawer.open() does not refresh the drawer's
  contents; only renderContents() does. /cart/add.js is now called with
  `sections: cart-drawer,cart-icon-bubble` and the response handed to
  renderContents(), which re-renders and opens. Without that the drawer
  opened showing the cart as it was before the add.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  BLOCKS (2026-09-22)
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The four steps are blocks (step_fit, step_size, step_plan,
  step_review, one each, numbered in block order) carrying their own
  heading, progress label, icon and step-specific copy, and the plans
  are `plan` blocks (key, label, price, ribbon, saving, was-price, Skio
  selling plan id, icon) so a third plan is an added block rather than
  a code change. The section keeps the anchor id and the product handle
  prefix: 31 settings became 2 plus blocks. The plan key is the handle
  suffix (prefix-fit-key) and the radio value the script reads.
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  ANCHOR FOR THE PAGE'S JOIN BUTTONS
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 rendered id="club-grunt-join-now" on its wrapper and every "Join"
  button on the club page links to that hash. The wrapper here already
  carries the id the script looks up, so the anchor is a thin outer div
  with an editable id (`anchor_id`) and a scroll margin for the sticky
  header.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-club-join.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  # Steps are the step_* blocks, numbered in block order; plans are the plan blocks.
  assign plan_blocks = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'plan'
-%}

{%- if s.anchor_id != blank -%}<div id="{{ s.anchor_id | strip | escape }}" class="gs-club__anchor">{%- endif -%}
<div class="gs-club" id="GsClub-{{ section.id }}" data-gs-club>
  <div class="page-width gs-club__inner">

    <div class="gs-club__steps">
      {%- assign step_no = 0 -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- assign b = block.settings -%}
        {%- case block.type -%}

          {%- when 'step_fit' -%}
            {%- assign step_no = step_no | plus: 1 -%}
            <fieldset class="gs-club__step{% if step_no == 1 %} is-active{% endif %}" data-club-step="{{ step_no }}" {% if step_no > 1 %}hidden{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <legend class="gs-club__heading">{{ b.heading }}</legend>
              <div class="gs-club__options gs-club__options--gender">
                {%- assign genders = 'mens,ladies' | split: ',' -%}
                {%- for g in genders -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    if g == 'mens'
                      assign g_label = b.mens_label | default: 'Male'
                    else
                      assign g_label = b.womens_label | default: 'Female'
                    endif
                  -%}
                  <div class="gs-club__option gs-club__option--gender">
                    <input
                      type="radio"
                      class="gs-club__input"
                      name="club_gender"
                      id="GsClubGender-{{ section.id }}-{{ g }}"
                      value="{{ g }}"
                      data-club-field="gender"
                    >
                    <label class="gs-club__label gs-club__label--gender" for="GsClubGender-{{ section.id }}-{{ g }}">
                      <span class="gs-club__eyebrow">{{ b.eyebrow | default: 'Patriotic' }}</span>
                      <span class="gs-club__label-main">{{ g_label }}</span>
                    </label>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </fieldset>

          {%- when 'step_size' -%}
            {%- assign step_no = step_no | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign sizes = b.sizes | default: 'S:Small,M:Medium,L:Large,XL,2XL,3XL,4XL' | split: ','
              assign womens_excluded = b.womens_excluded_sizes | default: '3XL,4XL' | split: ','
              assign size_icon_url = 'gs-club-icon-size.png' | asset_url
              if b.size_icon != blank
                assign size_icon_url = b.size_icon | image_url: width: 400
              endif
            -%}
            <fieldset class="gs-club__step{% if step_no == 1 %} is-active{% endif %}" data-club-step="{{ step_no }}" {% if step_no > 1 %}hidden{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <legend class="gs-club__heading">{{ b.heading }}</legend>
              <div class="gs-club__options gs-club__options--size" data-club-sizes>
                {%- for entry in sizes -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    # "S:Small" shows S and matches the variant titled Small.
                    assign pair = entry | split: ':'
                    assign size_label = pair[0] | strip
                    if pair.size > 1
                      assign size_value = pair[1] | strip
                    else
                      assign size_value = size_label
                    endif
                    if size_value == blank
                      continue
                    endif
                    assign size_key = size_value | downcase | handleize
                    assign size_value_down = size_value | downcase
                    assign size_label_down = size_label | downcase
                    assign womens_ok = true
                    for excluded in womens_excluded
                      assign excluded_clean = excluded | strip | downcase
                      if excluded_clean == size_value_down or excluded_clean == size_label_down
                        assign womens_ok = false
                        break
                      endif
                    endfor
                  -%}
                  <div
                    class="gs-club__option gs-club__option--size"
                    {% unless womens_ok %}data-mens-only="true"{% endunless %}
                  >
                    <input
                      type="radio"
                      class="gs-club__input"
                      name="club_size"
                      id="GsClubSize-{{ section.id }}-{{ size_key }}"
                      value="{{ size_value | escape }}"
                      data-club-field="size"
                    >
                    <label class="gs-club__label gs-club__label--size" for="GsClubSize-{{ section.id }}-{{ size_key }}">
                      <span class="gs-club__size">{{ size_label }}</span>
                      <img class="gs-club__size-icon" src="{{ size_icon_url }}" alt="" width="199" height="52" loading="lazy">
                    </label>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </fieldset>

          {%- when 'step_plan' -%}
            {%- assign step_no = step_no | plus: 1 -%}
            <fieldset class="gs-club__step{% if step_no == 1 %} is-active{% endif %}" data-club-step="{{ step_no }}" {% if step_no > 1 %}hidden{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <legend class="gs-club__heading">{{ b.heading }}</legend>

              {%- if b.disclaimer != blank -%}
                <p class="gs-club__disclaimer">{{ b.disclaimer }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

              <div class="gs-club__options gs-club__options--plan">
                {%- for plan in plan_blocks -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign pb = plan.settings
                    assign plan_key = pb.key | default: 'monthly' | handleize
                    assign plan_icon_url = 'gs-club-icon-monthly.svg' | asset_url
                    if plan_key == 'annual'
                      assign plan_icon_url = 'gs-club-icon-annual.svg' | asset_url
                    endif
                    if pb.icon != blank
                      assign plan_icon_url = pb.icon | image_url: width: 150
                    endif
                  -%}
                  <div class="gs-club__option gs-club__option--plan" {{ plan.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <input
                      type="radio"
                      class="gs-club__input"
                      name="club_plan"
                      id="GsClubPlan-{{ section.id }}-{{ plan_key }}"
                      value="{{ plan_key }}"
                      data-club-field="plan"
                      data-selling-plan="{{ pb.selling_plan_id }}"
                    >
                    <label class="gs-club__label gs-club__label--plan" for="GsClubPlan-{{ section.id }}-{{ plan_key }}">
                      <img class="gs-club__plan-icon" src="{{ plan_icon_url }}" alt="" width="75" height="75" loading="lazy">
                      <span class="gs-club__plan-type">{{ pb.label | default: plan_key }}</span>
                      <span class="gs-club__plan-cost">{{ pb.price }}</span>
                      {%- if pb.note != blank -%}
                        <span class="gs-club__ribbon">{{ pb.note }}</span>
                      {%- elsif pb.saving != blank or pb.was_price != blank -%}
                        <span class="gs-club__ribbon">
                          <strong>{{ pb.saving }}</strong>
                          {%- if pb.was_price != blank %} | <em class="gs-club__was">{{ pb.was_price }}</em>{% endif -%}
                        </span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </label>
                  </div>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </fieldset>

          {%- when 'step_review' -%}
            {%- assign step_no = step_no | plus: 1 -%}
            <div class="gs-club__step{% if step_no == 1 %} is-active{% endif %}" data-club-step="{{ step_no }}" {% if step_no > 1 %}hidden{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <h2 class="gs-club__heading">{{ b.heading }}</h2>

              <div class="gs-club__options gs-club__options--review">
                <div class="gs-club__review-cards" data-club-review>
                  <div class="gs-club__review-card" data-review="gender"></div>
                  <div class="gs-club__review-card" data-review="size"></div>
                  <div class="gs-club__review-card" data-review="plan"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="gs-club__actions">
                  <button type="button" class="gs-club__join" data-club-join>
                    {{ b.join_label | default: 'Join Now' }}
                  </button>
                  <button type="button" class="gs-club__restart" data-club-restart>
                    {{ b.restart_label | default: 'Start Over' }}
                  </button>
                  <p class="gs-club__error" role="alert" hidden data-club-error></p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
        {%- endcase -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    <ol class="gs-club__progress" data-club-progress>
      {%- assign step_no = 0 -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          case block.type
            when 'step_fit'
              assign icon_url = 'gs-club-step-1.jpg' | asset_url
              assign icon_size = '95%'
            when 'step_size'
              assign icon_url = 'gs-club-step-2.png' | asset_url
              assign icon_size = '50%'
            when 'step_plan'
              assign icon_url = 'gs-club-step-3.png' | asset_url
              assign icon_size = '40%'
            when 'step_review'
              assign icon_url = 'gs-club-step-4.png' | asset_url
              assign icon_size = '40%'
            else
              continue
          endcase
          assign step_no = step_no | plus: 1
          if block.settings.icon != blank
            assign icon_url = block.settings.icon | image_url: width: 200
          endif
        -%}
        {%- unless step_no == 1 -%}
          <li class="gs-club__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></li>
        {%- endunless -%}
        <li class="gs-club__progress-item{% if step_no == 1 %} is-current{% endif %}" data-progress-step="{{ step_no }}">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="gs-club__progress-btn"
            data-club-goto="{{ step_no }}"
            {% unless step_no == 1 %}disabled{% endunless %}
            {% if step_no == 1 %}aria-current="step"{% endif %}
          >
            <span class="gs-club__progress-circle" style="--step-icon: url('{{ icon_url }}'); --step-icon-size: {{ icon_size }};">{{ step_no }}</span>
            <span class="gs-club__progress-text">{{ block.settings.progress_label | strip }}</span>
          </button>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
{%- if s.anchor_id != blank -%}</div>{%- endif -%}

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.getElementById('GsClub-{{ section.id }}');
    if (!root) return;

    var handlePrefix = {{ s.product_handle_prefix | default: 'club' | json }};
    var cartUrl = {{ routes.cart_url | json }};
    var choice = { gender: '', size: '', plan: '', sellingPlan: '' };

    function goTo(step) {
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-club-step]').forEach(function (el) {
        var isTarget = el.dataset.clubStep === String(step);
        el.hidden = !isTarget;
        el.classList.toggle('is-active', isTarget);
      });

      root.querySelectorAll('[data-progress-step]').forEach(function (li) {
        var n = parseInt(li.dataset.progressStep, 10);
        li.classList.toggle('is-current', n === step);
        li.classList.toggle('is-done', n < step);

        var btn = li.querySelector('[data-club-goto]');
        if (n <= step) btn.disabled = false;
        if (n === step) {
          btn.setAttribute('aria-current', 'step');
        } else {
          btn.removeAttribute('aria-current');
        }
      });

      // Move focus into the new step so keyboard users are not stranded
      // at the bottom of the previous one.
      var active = root.querySelector('[data-club-step="' + step + '"]');
      var first = active ? active.querySelector('.gs-club__input, button') : null;
      if (first) first.focus({ preventScroll: true });
    }

    // The review step shows copies of the three chosen cards, exactly
    // as they looked when picked (v3 did the same with cloneNode).
    function refreshReview() {
      ['gender', 'size', 'plan'].forEach(function (key) {
        var box = root.querySelector('[data-review="' + key + '"]');
        if (!box) return;
        box.innerHTML = '';
        var input = root.querySelector('input[data-club-field="' + key + '"]:checked');
        if (!input) return;
        var label = root.querySelector('label[for="' + input.id + '"]');
        if (!label) return;
        var clone = label.cloneNode(true);
        clone.removeAttribute('for');
        clone.classList.add('gs-club__label--review');
        box.appendChild(clone);
      });
    }

    function showError(message) {
      var box = root.querySelector('[data-club-error]');
      if (!box) return;
      box.textContent = message;
      box.hidden = false;
    }

    function hideError() {
      var box = root.querySelector('[data-club-error]');
      if (box) box.hidden = true;
    }

    function resetFunnel() {
      choice = { gender: '', size: '', plan: '', sellingPlan: '' };
      root.querySelectorAll('.gs-club__input').forEach(function (i) { i.checked = false; });
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-mens-only]').forEach(function (el) { el.hidden = false; });
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-club-goto]').forEach(function (b, i) { b.disabled = i !== 0; });
      refreshReview();
      hideError();
      goTo(1);
    }

    root.addEventListener('change', function (evt) {
      var input = evt.target;
      if (!input.dataset || !input.dataset.clubField) return;

      choice[input.dataset.clubField] = input.value;
      if (input.dataset.sellingPlan) choice.sellingPlan = input.dataset.sellingPlan;

      // The women's fit does not carry the largest sizes.
      if (input.dataset.clubField === 'gender') {
        root.querySelectorAll('[data-mens-only]').forEach(function (el) {
          var hide = input.value !== 'mens';
          el.hidden = hide;
          var radio = el.querySelector('input');
          if (hide && radio && radio.checked) {
            radio.checked = false;
            choice.size = '';
          }
        });
      }

      refreshReview();

      var current = parseInt(input.closest('[data-club-step]').dataset.clubStep, 10);
      goTo(current + 1);
    });

    root.addEventListener('click', function (evt) {
      var goto = evt.target.closest('[data-club-goto]');
      if (goto && !goto.disabled) {
        goTo(parseInt(goto.dataset.clubGoto, 10));
        return;
      }

      if (evt.target.closest('[data-club-restart]')) {
        resetFunnel();
        return;
      }

      if (evt.target.closest('[data-club-join]')) join();
    });

    function join() {
      hideError();

      if (!choice.gender || !choice.size || !choice.plan) {
        showError('Please complete every step before joining.');
        return;
      }

      var btn = root.querySelector('[data-club-join]');
      if (btn) btn.disabled = true;

      var handle = handlePrefix + '-' + choice.gender + '-' + choice.plan;
      var drawer = document.querySelector('cart-drawer');

      fetch('/products/' + handle + '.js')
        .then(function (res) {
          if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Club product not found: ' + handle);
          return res.json();
        })
        .then(function (product) {
          var wanted = choice.size.toLowerCase();
          var match = null;

          for (var i = 0; i < product.variants.length; i++) {
            if (product.variants[i].title.toLowerCase() === wanted) {
              match = product.variants[i];
              break;
            }
          }
          if (!match) throw new Error('No variant for size ' + choice.size);

          // A missing selling plan would add the product at one-time
          // pricing instead of as a subscription, so it is required.
          if (!choice.sellingPlan) throw new Error('Selling plan not configured');

          var body = {
            id: match.id,
            quantity: 1,
            selling_plan: parseInt(choice.sellingPlan, 10)
          };
          // Ask for the drawer's sections so it can re-render itself.
          if (drawer && typeof drawer.renderContents === 'function') {
            body.sections = 'cart-drawer,cart-icon-bubble';
            body.sections_url = window.location.pathname;
          }

          return fetch('/cart/add.js', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', Accept: 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify(body)
          });
        })
        .then(function (res) {
          if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Could not add to cart');
          return res.json();
        })
        .then(function (added) {
          if (drawer && typeof drawer.renderContents === 'function' && added.sections) {
            drawer.renderContents(added);
          } else if (drawer && typeof drawer.open === 'function') {
            drawer.open();
          } else {
            window.location.href = cartUrl;
            return;
          }
          // Back to step one for the next signup, as v3 did.
          resetFunnel();
        })
        .catch(function (err) {
          console.error('[gs-club] ' + err.message);
          showError('Something went wrong. Please try again.');
        })
        .then(function () {
          if (btn) btn.disabled = false;
        });
    }

    goTo(1);
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Club Join Steps",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "gs-club-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "anchor_id",
      "label": "Anchor id",
      "info": "Join buttons elsewhere on the page link to #this-id.",
      "default": "club-grunt-join-now"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "product_handle_prefix",
      "label": "Product handle prefix",
      "info": "Handles are built as prefix-fit-plan, e.g. club-mens-monthly.",
      "default": "club"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "step_fit",
      "name": "Step: fit",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "Join Club Grunt Style"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "progress_label",
          "label": "Progress label",
          "default": "Patriot"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Progress icon",
          "info": "Shown in the circle while the step is current. Empty uses the built-in icon."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "eyebrow",
          "label": "Eyebrow text",
          "default": "Patriotic"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mens_label",
          "label": "Men's label",
          "default": "Male"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "womens_label",
          "label": "Women's label",
          "default": "Female"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "step_size",
      "name": "Step: size",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "label": "Heading",
          "default": "What Size Fits You Best?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "progress_label",
          "label": "Progress label",
          "default": "Size"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Progress icon",
          "info": "Shown in the circle while the step is current. Empty uses the built-in icon."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sizes",
          "label": "Sizes",
          "info": "Comma separated Label:Value pairs. The value must match the Club product's variant title, e.g. S:Small. A bare entry uses the same text for both.",
          "default": "S:Small,M:Medium,L:Large,XL,2XL,3XL,4XL"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "womens_excluded_sizes",
          "label": "Sizes not offered in the women's fit",
          "info": "Comma separated values or labels.",
          "default": "3XL,4XL"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "size_icon",
          "label": "Size icon",
          "info": "Empty uses the built-in ruler."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "step_plan",
      "name": "Step: plan",
